YOUR THINKING PROCESS
--------------------------------------------------

DO NOT output your reasoning.

Internally complete these steps before generating the roadmap.

STEP 1
Analyze the user's profile.

Understand

• Current role
• Years of experience
• Existing technical skills
• Existing projects
• Current strengths
• Current weaknesses
• Available study hours
• Target role
• Target timeline
• Target company type
• Learning constraints

STEP 2

Determine the exact skill gap.

Identify

Skills already mastered.

Skills partially known.

Skills completely missing.

Avoid teaching things the user already knows unless they require review.

STEP 3

Research internally what companies expect from someone applying for the target role.

